{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1000_p", "source_sha256": "40051acdd1cad8ffebd2ad429a7dcfe4f0e56239e7207cb955b828fd811f93cf", "ja": "お疲れ様、律子。衣装の試着は順調かな。\n見た感じは問題なさそうだけど。", "zh": "辛苦了，律子。服装试穿得还顺利吗？\n看上去好像没什么问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "1a6ceecb611a09220d95ca5b40f6147ec2ab10239c4737dcac6ebe7a522c8145", "ja": "ああっ！？　{$P$}……っ！？", "zh": "啊！？　{$P$}……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3af5e98cd0696bd6474a901ec8612783cab5c827603768311f6999fd2016df28", "ja": "あれ。なんか急に固まったぞ。どうした？\nな、何かマズかったか？", "zh": "咦？怎么突然僵住了。怎么了？\n难、难道是哪里不对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "8f31c88208b2e39296a773dcca81a05139460fb31e8e3fdf54e5098843730021", "ja": "あ、あ、いえ。その……えーと……、\nこれ……素敵な衣装です、ね。", "zh": "啊、啊，不，那个……呃……  \n这……是很棒的服装，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b5165adcdc9a044af15476b6e4c32a17b055cd0d3e87eb7ba9e82c9009cd57a2", "ja": "ウソつけ。めちゃくちゃ棒読みみたいになってる\nじゃないか。顔だって、不満そうな……。", "zh": "少装蒜了。你这说得也太像在棒读了吧。脸看起来也一副不满的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "7d94283dd50571ee863464a19b121e28cc1cbc9fcddde376d4b80262def0722f", "ja": "む、むぅ。不満……そう見えます？", "zh": "唔、唔……看起来……像是不满吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1006_p", "source_sha256": "44cc6d69ff656709d8c4cd124f45176f349ec5e559b2477a4447985a7a34a56e", "ja": "見える。……あれ、違うか？\nよく見たら、違う気もしてきたな……。んー……？", "zh": "看起来是。……等等，不对吗？仔细看，又觉得好像不太一样……嗯……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "4ebd7a87c2f10e95e003bdf3eba04a59607ef80dc2e63d32ccd92abeb94d0181", "ja": "そ、そんなに見るな。\n鈍感。にぶい。……ばか。", "zh": "别、别盯着我看。\n迟钝。木头。……笨蛋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4c0bccb64d80ab3d9e8fa10bfe2e477afa30ccadf43b6a1c743d4809b6350fc9", "ja": "あ。いやゴメン。……怒った？\nだけど、すまない。わからなくて……。", "zh": "啊，不，抱歉……生气了吗？\n但是，对不起，我没明白……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "bf99c8b28d5c92e55d496d0c25b99d71d3901baabdf645e05fa95d6b76b216b0", "ja": "言わないとダメです？\n全然、衣装に不満なんてないんですよ……？", "zh": "一定要说吗？我对服装根本就没有任何不满……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5b576d836b7d1dde56f9387e4373375df50b506d59659e3b97df3f7cc3a1541c", "ja": "そう言いながら、目を背けられるとな……。\nやっぱりどこか不満な点が……。", "zh": "嘴上这么说着，却又把视线移开……  \n果然还是有哪里不满意吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "cd81d02ef63fd296e43e21e3b5ec13912abca163e1a049cf954bb7a2bbcbb023", "ja": "い、いえ！　だから、そうじゃないんですよ。\nそうじゃなくて……。", "zh": "不、不是！所以，不是那样的。\n不是这个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "a4520ffe5f4ea4144512c5409c132daf3f946289239dd6b74a59439cbec71dee", "ja": "……どうして、私の欲しいものが、\nこんなに、わかっちゃったんだろうって……。", "zh": "……我只是在想，你怎么会\n这么清楚我想要的东西呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "6dfc91f7736f620a191016eeb28bf3ff982916cd1d486e4b7ca6cc4c8f58d336", "ja": "でも、あまりに思った通りだとなんというか、\n急に心を見透かされたみたいで……ね？", "zh": "不过，如果一切都太符合我的想法，总觉得……突然就像被看透了心思一样……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b3b28877c6d20a7826d70bf13fdc8550680b0c1010764eef8ef03635ef68d553", "ja": "そうなのか？　確かに今回の衣装は青羽さんと\nあまり相談もせず、俺の提案がほぼ通ったけど……。", "zh": "是这样吗？确实，这次的服装我也没怎么和青羽小姐商量，基本都采用了我的提案……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6218ffdd5e8b4b4e348b38e3e35729904162202bac12f9faf2dafe74f512e735", "ja": "でも、それは偶然だよ。律子にそんなに気に入って\nもらえたなら、俺はよほど運がいいんだな。", "zh": "不过，那只是偶然。能得到律子如此喜欢，我还真是相当走运啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "1b8f3ee84fd14b675192ac5dbe2217fd47d3c9937c9c1fddc65d139df3f26cf3", "ja": "え？　……ぷっ。あははは！\n{$P$}、正直ですね。", "zh": "诶？……噗。啊哈哈哈！\n{$P$}，您还真诚实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "4798a866e3b48a6931e45832a6b2d62c84fde33bc71e00cacb16c6cdbac71bf3", "ja": "じゃあ私も正直に言いますけど。この衣装、\nすっごく嬉しいです。いっぱい着たいです。", "zh": "那我也实话实说吧。这套服装，\n我真的特别开心。想多穿几次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1018_p", "source_sha256": "41e65d9c7eee2ca0cd247974e4bb04b48146cc640a7ade9d8b9c89bf14ee2a47", "ja": "急に素直になったな。よかった。でもどうして\nさっきは素直じゃなかったんだ？", "zh": "突然变得坦率了呢。太好了。不过为什么\n刚才却那么不坦率呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "0af91bfc25ecb32b7ec8a54004c9dbe97cd9390b424d7c7365cba3d068567be3", "ja": "あ、あのね……本当のことを言うのは\n恥ずかしい時があるのって、わかりません？", "zh": "啊，那个……有时候说实话会觉得害羞，这种心情你不明白吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1020_p", "source_sha256": "21091ea306dd94dbe8802ef7011d0a46b5bc143d0efd9005e0036a05dd0daab3", "ja": "わかるような……。いや、でもやっぱり本当のことなら\n恥ずかしくないかな。だって本当に似合うしかわ……", "zh": "我好像懂……不过，既然是实话，\n其实也没什么好害羞的吧。毕竟真的很适合，而且也很可……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "247770a5caf95a46841fcfe0936cd50231b712787ca3155feecc9d1a4912dd7c", "ja": "あああ、まったくもう！　{$P$}、\nそういうとこですよ、いい加減にしてください！", "zh": "啊啊啊，真是的！{$P$}，您就是总这样，差不多该收敛一下了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0254_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3cf5d4ab3988cf714337ea0f7758dac080a76cf6e9e10dd98caed7bb353c962c", "ja": "（行ってしまった。やっぱり少し怒ってるかな？\nでも……どこか楽しそうな、軽い足取りだった）", "zh": "（她走掉了。果然还是有点生气吗？但是……脚步却轻快得让人觉得她似乎很开心）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
